        "heading_line_3": "THE TREND",
        "body": "<p>LEGENDARY BRANDING was born from a belief that streetwear shouldn't be disposable. Every piece is designed to be lived in, broken in, and worn until it tells its own story.</p><p>We don't chase seasons. We chase construction. 235GSM tees. 400GSM hoodies. DTG prints that survive hundreds of washes. No fast fashion. No drops designed to fail.</p><p>Limited runs mean less waste and more intention. Once a piece sells out, it's gone. That's how we keep it special — for the people who found it, not the algorithm.</p>",
